<title>LITHUANIA: BOURSE CAPITALISATION RISES LAST WEEK.</title>
<headline>BOURSE CAPITALISATION RISES LAST WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The total capitalisation of the</p>
<p>Vilnius bourse rose to 8.5 billion litas last week from 8.2</p>
<p>billion litas the previous week, the stock exchange said on</p>
<p>Tuesday.</p>
<p>Vilnius bourse statistics:</p>
<p>					   July 28-Aug 1   July 21-25</p>
<p>    Submitted orders		 16,718	    16,289</p>
<p>    Executed orders		  1,362	     918</p>
<p>    Number of transactions on    876		 655</p>
<p>Central market (CM)</p>
<p>    Turnover on the CM in LTL    42.293 mln	18.015 mln</p>
<p>Number of transactions in</p>
<p>    block trades (BT)		243		 133</p>
<p>    Turnover of BT in LTL	  6.150 mln	 6.217 mln</p>
<p>    Supply of shares per week    64.873 mln	60.22 mln</p>
<p>    Demand of shares per week    6.328 mln	 6.571 mln</p>
<p>The number of transactions</p>
<p>    in government T-bills	  18		  8</p>
<p>The turnover of government</p>
<p>    T-bills in LTL per week	38.727 mln	15.245 mln</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom + 370 2 22 35 17</p>
